    "---\n",
    "\n",
    "## 3. Text Preprocessing\n",
    "\n",
    "Raw text is messy. Before we can convert it to numbers, we need to clean it up.\n",
    "The steps below are standard in traditional NLP pipelines:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Lowercase** — so \"Bank\" and \"bank\" are treated as the same word.\n",
    "- **Remove punctuation and digits** — symbols rarely carry meaning for classification.\n",
    "- **Tokenize** — split the sentence into individual words (tokens).\n",
    "- **Remove stopwords** — words like \"the\", \"a\", \"I\", \"was\" appear everywhere and\n",
    "  add noise without adding signal about the complaint topic.\n",
    "- **Lemmatize** — reduce words to their base form so \"charging\", \"charged\", and\n",
    "  \"charges\" all become \"charge\". This shrinks the vocabulary and groups related words."
   ]
  },
